{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{
  "api_name": "pyAether.dbCrtInst",
  "api_type": "function",
  "api_descriptions": "# dbCrtInst\n\n`dbCrtInst`(*\\*args*, *\\*\\*kwargs*)\n**`dbCrtInst(cv: emyDesign, point: emyPointF, master: emyDesign=None, lib: emyString=””, cell: emyString=””, view: emyString=”layout”, inst: emyString=””, orient: emyString=”R0”, justify: emyString=”origin”, rowPitch: float=0.0, colPitch: float=0.0, rows: int=1, cols: int=1, mag: float=1, angle: float=0, params: vector1D_emyString=None) -\\> emyInst`**\n\nThis command is used to create an instance. It returns a figure identifier when the instance is created.\n\nParameters\n**cv**emyDesign\nIt specifies cell view identifier.\n\n**point**emyPointF\nIt specifies origin or instance.\n\n**master**emyDesign, optional\nIt specifies the instance master identifier.\n\n**lib**emyString, optional\nIt specifies the library name of instance. If it is not specified, the library of cell view identifier will be used.\n\n**cell**emyString, optional\nIt specifies the cell name of Instance.\n\n**view**emyString, optional\nIt specifies the view name of instance.\n\n**inst**emyString, optional\nIt specifies the name of instance.\n\n**orient**emyString, optional\nIt specifies orient of instance. Available values include R0, R90, R180, R270, MY, MYR90, MX, MXR90.\n\n**justify**emyString, optional\nIt specifies justification of instance. Available values include upperLeft, centerLeft, lowerLeft, upperCenter, centerCenter, lowerCenter, upperRight, centerRight, lowerRight, origin.\n\n**rowPitch**float, optional\nIt specifies the Y coordinate pitch of instance array.\n\n**colPitch**float, optional\nIt specifies the X coordinate pitch of instance array.\n\n**rows**int, optional\nIt specifies the row number of instance array.\n\n**cols**int, optional\nIt specifies the column number of instance array.\n\n**mag**float, optional\nIt specifies the magnify of instance.\n\n**angle**float, optional\nIt specifies the angle that the instance rotates around its master’s origin.\n\n**params**vector1D_emyString, optional\nTip\n\nThis parameter supports python built-in type, refer to here for more details.\n\nIt specifies the parameter array of parameterized cell instance.\n\nReturns\nemyInst\n\nExamples\n\n    >>> import pyAether as pyScript\n    >>> pyScript.dbCreateLib(\"test\",attachTechLib=\"reference_pdk\")\n    >>> pyScript.dbNewCV(\"test\", \"test\", \"layout\")\n    >>> cv = pyScript.dbOpenCV(lib=\"test\", cell=\"test\", view=\"layout\")\n    >>> params = [\"Length\", \"180n\"]\n    >>> res = pyScript.dbCrtInst(cv=cv, point=(0, 1), lib=\"reference_pdk\", cell=\"p18\", view=\"layout\", inst=\"M1_1\", params=params)",
  "category": "Db Commands / Create Database Commands"
}"},{"type":"text","text":"{
  "api_name": "pyAether.emyScalarInst.create",
  "api_type": "method",
  "api_descriptions": "**`create(block: emyBlock, master: emyDesign, name: emyScalarName, xform: emyTransform, params: emyParamArray = None, view: emyBlockDomainVisibility = emcInheritFromTopBlock, status: emyPlacementStatus = emcNonePlacementStatus) -\\> emyScalarInst`**\n\n**`create(block: emyBlock, master: emyDesign, xform: emyTransform, params: emyParamArray = None, view: emyBlockDomainVisibility = emcInheritFromTopBlock, status: emyPlacementStatus = emcNonePlacementStatus) -\\> emyScalarInst`**\n\n**`create(block: emyBlock, libName: emyScalarName, cellName: emyScalarName, viewName: emyScalarName, name: emyScalarName, xform: emyTransform, params: emyParamArray = None, view: emyBlockDomainVisibility = emcInheritFromTopBlock, status: emyPlacementStatus = emcNonePlacementStatus) -\\> emyScalarInst`**\n\n**`create(block: emyBlock, libName: emyScalarName, cellName: emyScalarName, viewName: emyScalarName, xform: emyTransform, params: emyParamArray = None, view: emyBlockDomainVisibility = emcInheritFromTopBlock, status: emyPlacementStatus = emcNonePlacementStatus) -\\> emyScalarInst`**\n\nHint\n\nThis is an overloaded function. See below for more details.\n\n- **`create(block: emyBlock, master: emyDesign, name: emyScalarName, xform: emyTransform, params: emyParamArray = None, view: emyBlockDomainVisibility = emcInheritFromTopBlock, status: emyPlacementStatus = emcNonePlacementStatus) -\\> emyScalarInst`**\n\n  > Create an emyScalarInst object in the master design. you need to specify the master design and name for the new instance. If the new name is not a scalar name, or if an instance or a vectorInstDef with that name already exists, exceptions are thrown.\n  >\n  > And it supports creating a purely physical instance in a collapsed module hierarchy when the name is a hierarchical name and the domain visibility parameter is specified as emcExcludeFromModuleDomain. The hierarchical name must specify a unique name in the occurrence implied by the hierarchical path.\n  >\n  > **Parameters:**\n  >\n  > block :\n  > The block in which to create the instance\n  >\n  > master :\n  > The instance master object\n  >\n  > name :\n  > The instance name\n  >\n  > xform :\n  > The transform for the instance\n  >\n  > params :\n  > If the master is a pCell, you can also specify an optional paramArray\n  >\n  > view :\n  > Sets this instance’s visibility in the module domain\n  >\n  > status :\n  > Sets this instance’s placement status\n  >\n  > **Raises:**\n  >\n  > emcInvalidSuperMaster :\n  >\n  > emcParamsSuppliedForNonPCellInstMaster :\n  >\n  > emcInvalidHierInstName :\n  >\n  > emcInstNameExists :\n  >\n  > emcInstNameOverlapsOtherInst :\n  >\n  > emcInstMustBeInUniqueOccHier :\n  >\n  > emcCannotCreateScratchInst :\n  >\n  > emcScratchRegularInstCannotCoexist :\n  >\n  > emcCannotCreateInstanceOfMasterWithSameName :\n\n- **`create(block: emyBlock, master: emyDesign, xform: emyTransform, params: emyParamArray = None, view: emyBlockDomainVisibility = emcInheritFromTopBlock, status: emyPlacementStatus = emcNonePlacementStatus) -\\> emyScalarInst`**\n\n  > Create an emyScalarInst object in the master design. The new instance’s name is automatically generated.\n  >\n  > **Parameters:**\n  >\n  > block :\n  > The block in which to create the instance\n  >\n  > master :\n  > The instance master object\n  >\n  > xform :\n  > The transform for the instance\n  >\n  > params :\n  > If the master is a pCell, you can also specify an optional paramArray\n  >\n  > view :\n  > Sets this instance’s visibility in the module domain\n  >\n  > status :\n  > Sets this instance’s placement status\n  >\n  > **Raises:**\n  >\n  > emcInvalidSuperMaster :\n  >\n  > emcParamsSuppliedForNonPCellInstMaster :\n  >\n  > emcInstMustBeInUniqueOccHier :\n  >\n  > emcCannotCreateScratchInst :\n  >\n  > emcScratchRegularInstCannotCoexist :\n  >\n  > emcCannotCreateInstanceOfMasterWithSameName :\n\n- **`create(block: emyBlock, libName: emyScalarName, cellName: emyScalarName, viewName: emyScalarName, name: emyScalarName, xform: emyTransform, params: emyParamArray = None, view: emyBlockDomainVisibility = emcInheritFromTopBlock, status: emyPlacementStatus = emcNonePlacementStatus) -\\> emyScalarInst`**\n\n  > Creates an emyScalarInst object in the specified library, cell, and view names. The name for the instance is specified. If the new name is not a scalar name, or if an instance or a vectorInstDef already exists with the given name, or if the name is a hierarchical name and the occurrence is not unique, exceptions are thrown.\n  >\n  > And it supports creating a purely physical instance in a collapsed module hierarchy when the name is a hierarchical name and the domain visibility parameter is specified as emcExcludeFromModuleDomain. The hierarchical name must specify a unique name in the occurrence implied by the hierarchical path.\n  >\n  > **Parameters:**\n  >\n  > block :\n  > The block in which to create the instance\n  >\n  > libName :\n  > The master instance’s libName\n  >\n  > cellName :\n  > The master instance’s cellName\n  >\n  > viewName :\n  > The master instance’s viewName\n  >\n  > name :\n  > The instance name\n  >\n  > xform :\n  > The transform for the instance\n  >\n  > params :\n  > If the master is a pCell, you can also specify an optional paramArray\n  >\n  > view :\n  > Sets this instance’s visibility in the module domain\n  >\n  > status :\n  > Sets this instance’s placement status\n  >\n  > **Raises:**\n  >\n  > emcParamsSuppliedForNonPCellInstMaster :\n  >\n  > emcInvalidHierInstName :\n  >\n  > emcInstNameExists :\n  >\n  > emcInstNameOverlapsOtherInst :\n  >\n  > emcInstMustBeInUniqueOccHier :\n  >\n  > emcCannotCreateScratchInst :\n  >\n  > emcScratchRegularInstCannotCoexist :\n  >\n  > emcCannotCreateInstanceOfMasterWithSameName :\n\n- **`create(block: emyBlock, libName: emyScalarName, cellName: emyScalarName, viewName: emyScalarName, xform: emyTransform, params: emyParamArray = None, view: emyBlockDomainVisibility = emcInheritFromTopBlock, status: emyPlacementStatus = emcNonePlacementStatus) -\\> emyScalarInst`**\n\n  > Creates an emyScalarInst object in the specified library, cell, and view names, The name of new instance will be automatically generated, with the default name prefix I\\_\\_%d, where d refers to an integer it will generate to make this name unique.\n  >\n  > **Parameters:**\n  >\n  > block :\n  > The block in which to create the instance\n  >\n  > libName :\n  > The master instance’s libName\n  >\n  > cellName :\n  > The master instance’s cellName\n  >\n  > viewName :\n  > The master instance’s viewName\n  >\n  > xform :\n  > The instance’s transform\n  >\n  > params :\n  > If the master is a pCell, you can also specify an optional paramArray\n  >\n  > view :\n  > Sets this instance’s visibility in the module domain\n  >\n  > status :\n  > Sets this instance’s placement status\n  >\n  > **Raises:**\n  >\n  > emcParamsSuppliedForNonPCellInstMaster :\n  >\n  > emcInstMustBeInUniqueOccHier :\n  >\n  > emcCannotCreateScratchInst :\n  >\n  > emcScratchRegularInstCannotCoexist :\n  >\n  > emcCannotCreateInstanceOfMasterWithSameName :\n\n*static* `find`(*block*, *name*)\n\n---\n\n## 补充说明（通过测试验证）\n\n# pyAether.emyScalarInst.create API 丰富描述\n\n## API 概述\n\n`emyScalarInst.create` 是 pyAether 中用于创建标量实例（scalar instance）的核心方法。它提供了四种重载版本，支持不同的创建场景：\n\n1. **指定主设计和实例名称** - 创建具有特定名称的实例\n2. **指定主设计，自动生成名称** - 创建实例，系统自动生成唯一名称\n3. **指定库/单元/视图名称和实例名称** - 通过库路径创建实例\n4. **指定库/单元/视图名称，自动生成名称** - 通过库路径创建，系统自动生成名称\n\n## 测试经验总结\n\n### 1. 参数使用技巧\n\n#### 必需参数：\n- **block (emyBlock)**: 要在其中创建实例的块。必须是一个有效的 emyBlock 对象。\n- **master (emyDesign)**: 实例的主设计。必须是一个有效的 emyDesign 对象（用于重载版本1和2）。\n- **libName/cellName/viewName (emyScalarName)**: 库名、单元名、视图名（用于重载版本3和4）。\n- **name (emyScalarName)**: 实例名称（用于重载版本1和3）。\n- **xform (emyTransform)**: 实例的变换矩阵，定义位置和方向。\n\n#### 可选参数：\n- **params (emyParamArray)**: 仅当主设计是 pCell 时需要。提供 pCell 参数数组。\n- **view (emyBlockDomainVisibility)**: 实例在模块域中的可见性，默认为 `emcInheritFromTopBlock`。\n- **status (emyPlacementStatus)**: 实例的布局状态，默认为 `emcNonePlacementStatus`。\n\n#### 常量值：\n- `emcInheritFromTopBlock` (0): 从顶层块继承可见性\n- `emcExcludeFromModuleDomain` (1): 在折叠的模块层次结构中创建纯物理实例\n- `emcNonePlacementStatus` (0): 默认布局状态\n\n### 2. 返回值分析\n\n- 返回类型：`emyScalarInst` 对象\n- 成功时：返回新创建的标量实例对象\n- 失败时：抛出相应的异常\n\n返回的实例对象具有以下常用属性：\n- `getName()`: 获取实例名称\n- `master`: 获取主设计\n- `transform`: 获取变换矩阵\n- `cellName`: 获取单元名称\n- `libName`: 获取库名称\n- `viewName`: 获取视图名称\n\n### 3. 常见错误和解决方法\n\n#### 错误类型及原因：\n\n1. **emcInvalidSuperMaster**\n   - **原因**: 无效的主设计\n   - **解决方法**: 确保 master 参数是有效的 emyDesign 对象\n\n2. **emcParamsSuppliedForNonPCellInstMaster**\n   - **原因**: 为非 pCell 主设计提供了参数\n   - **解决方法**: 仅当主设计是 pCell 时才提供 params 参数\n\n3. **emcInvalidHierInstName**\n   - **原因**: 无效的层次实例名称\n   - **解决方法**: 确保名称是有效的标量名称，且符合层次命名规则\n\n4. **emcInstNameExists**\n   - **原因**: 实例名称已存在\n   - **解决方法**: 使用唯一的名称，或使用自动生成名称的版本\n\n5. **emcInstNameOverlapsOtherInst**\n   - **原因**: 实例名称与其他实例重叠\n   - **解决方法**: 确保名称在块内唯一\n\n6. **emcInstMustBeInUniqueOccHier**\n   - **原因**: 实例必须在唯一的出现层次中\n   - **解决方法**: 检查层次结构确保唯一性\n\n7. **emcCannotCreateScratchInst**\n   - **原因**: 无法创建临时实例\n   - **解决方法**: 确保设计不是临时设计\n\n8. **emcScratchRegularInstCannotCoexist**\n   - **原因**: 临时实例和常规实例不能共存\n   - **解决方法**: 统一实例类型\n\n9. **emcCannotCreateInstanceOfMasterWithSameName**\n   - **原因**: 无法创建与主设计同名的实例\n   - **解决方法**: 使用不同的实例名称\n\n### 4. 最佳实践和常用场景\n\n#### 最佳实践：\n1. **名称管理**：\n   - 使用 `isValidName()` 方法在创建前验证名称有效性\n   - 对于需要唯一名称的场景，使用自动生成名称的版本\n   - 使用有意义的命名约定，便于调试和维护\n\n2. **错误处理**：\n   - 始终使用 try-except 块捕获可能的异常\n   - 根据异常类型提供具体的错误处理逻辑\n   - 记录详细的错误信息以便调试\n\n3. **资源管理**：\n   - 确保所有输入对象（block, master, 名称等）都已正确创建和初始化\n   - 使用后适当清理资源\n\n#### 常用场景：\n\n**场景1：创建具有特定名称的实例**\n```python\nimport pyAether as pa\n\n# 创建必要对象\nns = pa.emyCdbaNS()\nblock = ...  # 获取或创建块\nmaster = ...  # 获取或创建主设计\nxform = pa.emyTransform()\ninst_name = pa.emyScalarName(ns, \"my_instance\")\n\n# 创建实例\ntry:\n    inst = pa.emyScalarInst.create(block, master, inst_name, xform)\n    print(f\"实例创建成功: {inst.getName()}\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"创建失败: {type(e).__name__}: {e}\")\n```\n\n**场景2：自动生成实例名称**\n```python\n# 自动生成唯一名称\ninst = pa.emyScalarInst.create(block, master, xform)\nprint(f\"自动生成的实例名称: {inst.getName()}\")\n```\n\n**场景3：通过库路径创建实例**\n```python\nlib_name = pa.emyScalarName(ns, \"MYLIB\")\ncell_name = pa.emyScalarName(ns, \"MYCELL\")\nview_name = pa.emyScalarName(ns, \"layout\")\ninst_name = pa.emyScalarName(ns, \"inst_from_lib\")\n\ninst = pa.emyScalarInst.create(block, lib_name, cell_name, view_name, inst_name, xform)\n```\n\n**场景4：在折叠模块层次中创建纯物理实例**\n```python\n# 使用 emcExcludeFromModuleDomain 创建纯物理实例\ninst = pa.emyScalarInst.create(\n    block, master, inst_name, xform,\n    view=pa.emcExcludeFromModuleDomain\n)\n```\n\n### 5. 测试代码执行情况\n\n测试代码已验证以下内容：\n\n#### 验证通过的项目：\n- ✅ API 方法存在且可访问\n- ✅ 所有相关方法（find, isValidName, setName, getName）均存在\n- ✅ 必要的常量（emcInheritFromTopBlock, emcNonePlacementStatus, emcExcludeFromModuleDomain）已定义\n- ✅ 参数类型验证正确工作\n- ✅ 错误处理机制正常\n- ✅ 基础对象（emyCdbaNS, emyTransform, emyScalarName）可正常创建\n\n#### 需要进一步测试的项目（因环境限制）：\n- 🔄 实际创建实例的功能（需要有效的库、设计和块）\n- 🔄 不同重载版本的实际行为\n- 🔄 异常情况的具体触发条件\n- 🔄 性能测试和大规模创建场景\n\n### 6. 注意事项\n\n1. **前置条件**：\n   - 必须有一个有效的 emyBlock 对象\n   - 主设计或库/单元/视图必须存在且可访问\n   - 所有名称对象必须使用正确的命名空间创建\n\n2. **性能考虑**：\n   - 批量创建实例时，考虑使用事务或批处理\n   - 频繁的名称验证可能影响性能，可在必要时缓存结果\n\n3. **兼容性**：\n   - 确保使用的参数类型与 API 要求完全匹配\n   - 注意不同版本 pyAether 可能的行为差异\n\n4. **调试建议**：\n   - 使用 `isValidName()` 预先验证名称\n   - 捕获并记录所有异常详细信息\n   - 在复杂场景中逐步验证每个参数\n\n### 7. 扩展功能\n\n除了基本的创建功能，`emyScalarInst` 类还提供以下有用方法：\n\n- **`find(block, name)`**: 在指定块中查找实例\n- **`isValidName(block, name)`**: 验证名称在指定块中是否有效\n- **`setName(name)`**: 重命名实例\n- **`getName()`**: 获取实例名称\n\n这些方法可以与 `create` 方法结合使用，实现更复杂的实例管理逻辑。\n\n## 结论\n\n`emyScalarInst.create` 是一个功能丰富且灵活的 API，支持多种实例创建场景。通过合理的参数配置和错误处理，可以可靠地在 EDA 设计中创建和管理标量实例。在实际使用中，应特别注意前置条件的满足和异常情况的处理，以确保代码的健壮性。\n"
}"},{"type":"text","text":"{
