  "api_descriptions": "# emyCellViewExt\n\n*class* `emyCellViewExt`\n**`emyCellViewExt()`**\n\nConstructor of emyCellViewExt class.\n\n`clear`()\n**`clear()`**\n\nClear the content of emyCellViewExt.\n\n`getCell`(*lib*, *cell*)\n**`getCell(lib: emyScalarName, cell: emyScalarName) -\\> emyCell`**\n\nGet cell by specified lib name and cell name.\n\nParameters\n**lib**emyScalarName\nThe specified lib name.\n\n**cell**emyScalarName\nThe specified cell name.\n\nReturns\n**out**emyCell\nReturned cell.\n\n`getCellView`(*lib*, *cell*, *view*)\n**`getCellView(lib: emyScalarName, cell: emyScalarName, view: emyScalarName) -\\> emyCellView`**\n\nGet cell view by specified lib name, cell name and view name.\n\nParameters\n**lib**emyScalarName\nThe specified lib name.\n\n**cell**emyScalarName\nThe specified cell name.\n\n**view**emyScalarName\nThe specified view name.\n\nReturns\n**out**emyCellView\nReturned cell view.\n\n`getLib`(*lib*)\n**`getLib(lib: emyScalarName) -\\> emyLib`**\n\nGet lib by given lib name.\n\nParameters\n**lib**emyScalarName\nThe specified lib name.\n\nReturns\n**out**emyLib\nReturned lib.\n\n`getLibAcc`()\n**`getLibAcc() -\\> emyLibAccessExt`**\n\nGet an object of emyLibAccessExt.\n\nReturns\n**out**emyLibAccessExt\nReturned object of emyLibAccessExt.\n\n`getViewNames`(*\\*args*)\n**`getViewNames(libName: emyScalarName, force: emyBoolean=False) -\\> emyArray_emyScalarName`**\n\n**`getViewNames(libName: emyScalarName, cellName: emyScalarName, force: emyBoolean=False) -\\> emyArray_emyScalarName`**\n\nHint\n\nThis is an overloaded function. See below for more details.\n\n- **`getViewNames(libName: emyScalarName, force: emyBoolean=False) -\\> emyArray_emyScalarName`**\n\n  Get view name by specified lib name.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  libNameemyScalarName\n  The specified lib name.\n\n  forceemyBoolean, optional\n  Force to flush the cell view. default value is False.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  outemyArray_emyScalarName\n  Returned view name array.\n\n- **`getViewNames(libName: emyScalarName, cellName: emyScalarName, force: emyBoolean=False) -\\> emyArray_emyScalarName`**\n\n  Get view name by specified lib name and cell name.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  libNameemyScalarName\n  The specified lib name.\n\n  cellNameemyScalarName\n  The specified cell name.\n\n  forceemyBoolean, optional\n  Force to flush the cell view. default value is False.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  outemyArray_emyScalarName\n  Returned view name array.\n\n`getViewStrs`(*\\*args*)\n**`getViewStrs(lib: emyScalarName, ns: emyNameSpace=emyCdbaNS ( ), force: emyBoolean=False) -\\> emyStringArray`**\n\n**`getViewStrs(lib: emyScalarName, cell: emyScalarName, ns: emyNameSpace=emyCdbaNS ( ), force: emyBoolean=False) -\\> emyStringArray`**\n\nHint\n\nThis is an overloaded function. See below for more details.\n\n- **`getViewStrs(lib: emyScalarName, ns: emyNameSpace=emyCdbaNS ( ), force: emyBoolean=False) -\\> emyStringArray`**\n\n  Get view string array by specified lib name.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  libemyScalarName\n  The specified lib name.\n\n  nsemyNameSpace, optional\n  Name space. default value is emyCdbaNS ( ).\n\n  forceemyBoolean, optional\n  Force to flush the cell view. default value is False.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  outemyStringArray\n  Returned view string array.\n\n- **`getViewStrs(lib: emyScalarName, cell: emyScalarName, ns: emyNameSpace=emyCdbaNS ( ), force: emyBoolean=False) -\\> emyStringArray`**\n\n  Get view string array by specified lib name and cell name.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  libemyScalarName\n  The specified lib name.\n\n  cellemyScalarName\n  The specified cell name.\n\n  nsemyNameSpace, optional\n  Name space, default value is emyCdbaNS ( ).\n\n  forceemyBoolean, optional\n  Force to flush the cell view, default value is False.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  outemyStringArray\n  Returned view string array.\n\n`getViewType`(*lib*, *cell*, *view*)\n**`getViewType(lib: emyScalarName, cell: emyScalarName, view: emyScalarName) -\\> emyViewType`**\n\nGet view type by specified lib name, cell name and view name.\n\nParameters\n**lib**emyScalarName\nThe specified lib name.\n\n**cell**emyScalarName\nThe specified cell name.\n\n**view**emyScalarName\nThe specified view name.\n\nReturns\n**out**emyViewType\nReturned view type.",
