  "api_descriptions": "# emyBoxMergeBoxs\n\n`emyBoxMergeBoxs`(*inBoxs*, *outBoxs*, *wid=1*, *sortByX=True*)\n**`emyBoxMergeBoxs(inBoxs: emyArray_emyBox, outBoxs: emyArray_emyBox, wid: emyInt4=1, sortByX: emyBoolean=True)`**\n\nMerge box, only merge those box has same width or height, and the distance between two boxes less than wid.\n\nParameters\n**inBoxs**emyArray_emyBox\nboxArray for merge.\n\n**outBoxs**emyArray_emyBox\nMerged boxArray.\n\n**wid**emyInt4, optional\nMin distance of two boxes. The default value is 1.\n\n**sortByX**emyBoolean, optional\nThe default value is True.\n\nExamples\n\n    >>> import pyAether\n    >>> in_box_arr = pyAether.emyArray_emyBox()\n    >>> out_box_arr = pyAether.emyArray_emyBox()\n    >>> in_box_arr.append(pyAether.emyBox(5, 5, 8, 8))\n    >>> pyAether.emyBoxMergeBoxs(in_box_arr, out_box_arr)",
