  "api_descriptions": "# dmGetObjType\n\n`dmGetObjType`(*\\*args*)\n**`dmGetObjType(obj: dmLibObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n**`dmGetObjType(obj: dmCellObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n**`dmGetObjType(obj: dmViewObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n**`dmGetObjType(obj: dmLibFileObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n**`dmGetObjType(obj: dmCellFileObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n**`dmGetObjType(obj: dmViewFileObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\nHint\n\nThis is an overloaded function. See below for more details.\n\n- **`dmGetObjType(obj: dmLibObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n  Returns the type of the given object.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  objdmLibObj\n  The dmLibObj is returned by function `dmGetObj` with a library.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  out : emyString\n\n  **Examples**\n\n      >>> import pyAether as pyScript\n      >>> lib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"test_adv\")\n      >>> dm_lib_obj = pyScript.dmGetObj(lib_name)\n      >>> pyScript.dmGetObjType(dm_lib_obj)\n\n- **`dmGetObjType(obj: dmCellObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n  Returns the type of the given object.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  objdmCellObj\n  The dmCellObj is returned by function `dmGetObj` with a cell in a library.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  out : emyString\n\n  **Examples**\n\n      >>> import pyAether as pyScript\n      >>> lib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"test_adv\")\n      >>> cell_name = pyScript.emyString(\"REFF2\")\n      >>> dm_cell_obj = pyScript.dmGetObj(lib_name, cell_name)\n      >>> pyScript.dmGetObjType(dm_cell_obj)\n\n- **`dmGetObjType(obj: dmViewObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n  Returns the type of the given object.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  objdmViewObj\n  The dmViewObj is returned by function `dmGetObj` with a view in a cell.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  out : emyString\n\n  **Examples**\n\n      >>> import pyAether as pyScript\n      >>> lib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"test_adv\")\n      >>> cell_name = pyScript.emyString(\"REFF2\")\n      >>> view_name = pyScript.emyString(\"layout\")\n      >>> dm_view_obj = pyScript.dmGetObj(lib_name, cell_name, view_name)\n      >>> pyScript.dmGetObjType(dm_view_obj)\n\n- **`dmGetObjType(obj: dmLibFileObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n  Returns the type of the given object.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  objdmLibFileObj\n  The dmLibFileObj is returned by function `dmGetObj` with a file in the library directory.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  out : emyString\n\n  **Examples**\n\n      >>> import pyAether as pyScript\n      >>> lib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"test_adv\")\n      >>> file = pyScript.emyString(\"tech.db\")\n      >>> lib_file_obj = pyScript.dmGetObjF(lib_name, file)\n      >>> pyScript.dmGetObjType(lib_file_obj)\n\n- **`dmGetObjType(obj: dmCellFileObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n  Returns the type of the given object.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  objdmCellFileObj\n  The dmCellFileObj is returned by function `dmGetObj` with a file in the cell directory.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  out : emyString\n\n  **Examples**\n\n      >>> import pyAether as pyScript\n      >>> lib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"test_adv\")\n      >>> cell_name = pyScript.emyString(\"REFF2\")\n      >>> file = pyScript.emyString(\"data.dm\")\n      >>> cell_file_obj = pyScript.dmGetObjF(lib_name, cell_name, file)\n      >>> pyScript.dmGetObjType(cell_file_obj)\n\n- **`dmGetObjType(obj: dmViewFileObj) -\\> emyString`**\n\n  Returns the type of the given object.\n\n  **Parameters**\n\n  objdmViewFileObj\n  The dmViewFileObj is returned by function `dmGetObj` with a file in the view directory.\n\n  **Returns**\n\n  out : emyString\n\n  **Examples**\n\n      >>> import pyAether as pyScript\n      >>> lib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"test_adv\")\n      >>> cell_name = pyScript.emyString(\"REFF2\")\n      >>> view_name = pyScript.emyString(\"layout\")\n      >>> file = pyScript.emyString(\"layout.oa\")\n      >>> view_file_obj = pyScript.dmGetObjF(lib_name, cell_name, view_name, file)\n      >>> pyScript.dmGetObjType(view_file_obj)\n\n---\n\n## 补充说明（通过测试验证）\n\n# dmGetObjType API 详细说明\n\n## 函数概述\n\n`dmGetObjType` 是一个重载函数，用于获取数据库对象（dm对象）的类型。该函数接受不同类型的dm对象作为参数，并返回表示对象类型的字符串。\n\n## 函数签名\n\n```python\ndmGetObjType(obj: dmLibObj) -> emyString\ndmGetObjType(obj: dmCellObj) -> emyString\ndmGetObjType(obj: dmViewObj) -> emyString\ndmGetObjType(obj: dmLibFileObj) -> emyString\ndmGetObjType(obj: dmCellFileObj) -> emyString\ndmGetObjType(obj: dmViewFileObj) -> emyString\n```\n\n## 参数说明\n\n### obj\n- **类型**: `dmLibObj` | `dmCellObj` | `dmViewObj` | `dmLibFileObj` | `dmCellFileObj` | `dmViewFileObj`\n- **描述**: 数据库对象实例，通过 `dmGetObj` 或 `dmGetObjF` 函数获取\n- **必需**: 是\n\n## 返回值\n\n- **类型**: `emyString`\n- **描述**: 返回表示对象类型的字符串。可能的返回值包括：\n  - `\"libType\"` - 库对象类型\n  - `\"cellType\"` - 单元对象类型\n  - `\"viewType\"` - 视图对象类型\n  - `\"libFileType\"` - 库文件对象类型\n  - `\"cellFileType\"` - 单元文件对象类型\n  - `\"viewFileType\"` - 视图文件对象类型\n\n## 使用示例\n\n### 示例1：获取库对象类型\n```python\nimport pyAether as pyScript\n\n# 获取库对象\nlib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"TECHLIB\")\ndm_lib_obj = pyScript.dmGetObj(lib_name)\n\n# 获取库对象类型\nlib_type = pyScript.dmGetObjType(dm_lib_obj)\nprint(f\"Library type: {lib_type}\")  # 输出: libType\n```\n\n### 示例2：获取单元对象类型\n```python\nimport pyAether as pyScript\n\n# 获取单元对象\nlib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"TECHLIB\")\ncell_name = pyScript.emyString(\"CAPPARAVSS\")\ndm_cell_obj = pyScript.dmGetObj(lib_name, cell_name)\n\n# 获取单元对象类型\ncell_type = pyScript.dmGetObjType(dm_cell_obj)\nprint(f\"Cell type: {cell_type}\")  # 输出: cellType\n```\n\n### 示例3：获取视图对象类型\n```python\nimport pyAether as pyScript\n\n# 获取视图对象\nlib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"TECHLIB\")\ncell_name = pyScript.emyString(\"CAPPARAVSS\")\nview_name = pyScript.emyString(\"auCdl\")\ndm_view_obj = pyScript.dmGetObj(lib_name, cell_name, view_name)\n\n# 获取视图对象类型\nview_type = pyScript.dmGetObjType(dm_view_obj)\nprint(f\"View type: {view_type}\")  # 输出: viewType\n```\n\n### 示例4：获取文件对象类型\n```python\nimport pyAether as pyScript\n\n# 获取库文件对象\nlib_name = pyScript.emyString(\"TECHLIB\")\nfile_name = pyScript.emyString(\"tech.db\")\nlib_file_obj = pyScript.dmGetObjF(lib_name, file_name)\n\n# 获取库文件对象类型\